1
00:01:37,670 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:43,700
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:45,950
[Episode 6]

4
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:46,540
[Murder Warning by the Black Chest]

5
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,680
For many years, Northern Kun

6
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,520
has had constant friction
with our dynasty.

7
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,180
Years ago, they marched south

8
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,400
and confronted Prince Ping's border army

9
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,840
for months.

10
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,590
The delegation came this time

11
00:03:04,590 --> 00:03:05,960
in the name of exchanging credentials

12
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,080
to seek a truce.

13
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:08,840
In fact, they intend to

14
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,570
spy on our dynasty's strength.

15
00:03:10,710 --> 00:03:11,710
I propose

16
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:13,310
that we should let Wenbu

17
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,120
see our army's ceremonial drill

18
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,850
to show our national prestige.

19
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,910
Meanwhile,

20
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:22,160
[The Eldest Prince of the Shi Empire,
Prince Ding Zhou Miao]

21
00:03:18,150 --> 00:03:20,870
tell Prince Ping
to stand ready at the border

22
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,320
to prevent Northern Kun from invading.

23
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,160
Your Majesty,

24
00:03:26,230 --> 00:03:27,140
I think

25
00:03:27,190 --> 00:03:28,680
there's no need for such trouble.

26
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,410
In dealing with such barbarians,

27
00:03:30,410 --> 00:03:31,270
there's no need to be polite.

28
00:03:31,270 --> 00:03:32,590
Just detain Wenbu,

29
00:03:32,620 --> 00:03:34,350
and they won't dare to send troops rashly.

30
00:03:34,350 --> 00:03:36,950
The border crisis
will naturally be resolved.

31
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,590
Miao, you must understand that

32
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,430
Wenbu is the Crown Prince of Northern Kun.

33
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,750
A Crown Prince

34
00:03:44,270 --> 00:03:46,000
is the foundation of a country.

35
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,630
He's the key.

36
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:48,870
He is not someone

37
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,960
that a low-born illegitimate prince

38
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,960
or any random nobody

39
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,310
can compare to.

40
00:03:59,710 --> 00:04:01,000
As far as I know,

41
00:04:01,190 --> 00:04:01,960
this Wenbu

42
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,960
has been traveling through our Great Shi,

43
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:06,890
indulging in wine and women
and acting shamelessly.

44
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:09,820
Such a coward

45
00:04:10,130 --> 00:04:11,960
may have the title of Crown Prince,

46
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,030
but he only relies on

47
00:04:13,030 --> 00:04:15,190
his mother being the legitimate wife.

48
00:04:15,210 --> 00:04:17,040
In fact, he is good for nothing.

49
00:04:17,750 --> 00:04:18,600
In my opinion,

50
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:21,040
the Khan of Northern Kun may not,

51
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,950
for this useless son,

52
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:25,600
give up his grand ambition.

53
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:29,360
Miao—

54
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,600
The Crown Prince said

55
00:04:31,750 --> 00:04:32,950
to detain Wenbu.

56
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,870
The First Prince said

57
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:38,320
we should prepare for war
to show our prestige.

58
00:04:43,750 --> 00:04:44,950
Grand Secretary Bai,

59
00:04:45,950 --> 00:04:47,720
what do you have to say?

60
00:04:48,290 --> 00:04:50,409
[Bai Qi, Senior Grand Secretary]

61
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:55,560
That year,

62
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:58,360
I followed the late Emperor Wuzong of Shi

63
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,560
to attack Liluo.

64
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:00,920
Sleeping in the mountains,

65
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,270
I suddenly heard wolves howling

66
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:03,750
outside the tent at night.

67
00:05:04,310 --> 00:05:05,950
I was very scared,

68
00:05:06,390 --> 00:05:08,870
but I didn't dare to go out
and see what was going on.

69
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:10,800
The sound got closer and closer,

70
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,920
closer and closer,

71
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:14,270
and I got more and more scared.

72
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,460
Until that thing came to the tent,

73
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,190
I suddenly remembered

74
00:05:18,310 --> 00:05:19,440
that inside my tent,

75
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:22,560
there were still
over a dozen armored soldiers standing.

76
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,760
Grand Secretary Bai,

77
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:25,070
what does this

78
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:28,060
have to do with
the Northern Kun delegation?

79
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,390
What I mean is,

80
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,120
when others are in our territory,

81
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:33,920
they should be the ones
facing a formidable enemy,

82
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,480
not us.

83
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,320
Grand Secretary Bai,

84
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:42,270
are you done with the story?

85
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,040
Later we found out

86
00:05:44,070 --> 00:05:45,130
it wasn't a jackal,

87
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:46,600
just a wild dog,

88
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,200
and a very well-behaved one.

89
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,360
Good.

90
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,560
If it's a dog,

91
00:05:53,159 --> 00:05:54,830
we treat it with courtesy.

92
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:56,040
If it's a jackal,

93
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:58,360
we have soldiers too.

94
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,190
Let's wait and see.

95
00:06:00,430 --> 00:06:01,240
Good.

96
00:06:02,270 --> 00:06:04,310
Send word to the Northern Kun delegation.

97
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:05,840
They've had a hard journey.

98
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,600
Let them rest at the Envoy Residence.

99
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,260
Treat them with state honors.

100
00:06:10,270 --> 00:06:11,430
Do not neglect them.

101
00:06:11,950 --> 00:06:13,970
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

102
00:06:13,970 --> 00:06:16,070
[Envoy Residence]

103
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,560
The Divine Constable Bureau
will send elites

104
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,070
to guard the Envoy Residence.

105
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:19,620
[Envoy Residence]

106
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:20,190
There must be no mistakes.

107
00:06:25,110 --> 00:06:28,960
[Envoy Residence]

108
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,560
Your Highness, mind the steps.

109
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,680
These are gifts from various officials

110
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,680
to you.

111
00:06:38,750 --> 00:06:40,600
This is an ancient jade fossil,

112
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,000
extremely rare and precious.

113
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:42,560
Look,

114
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,750
there are so many

115
00:06:43,750 --> 00:06:44,950
rare treasures here.

116
00:06:50,170 --> 00:06:51,050
What is this?

117
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:52,159
Strange.

118
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:54,390
This black chest isn't on the gift list.

119
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:45,190
Your Highness, are you alright?

120
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:46,320
You call this a gift?

121
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:48,270
Such an ominous object.

122
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,240
This is clearly a curse,

123
00:07:50,350 --> 00:07:52,159
a provocation to Northern Kun!

124
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,600
Please calm down, My Lord!

125
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,630
I really didn't know!

126
00:07:54,630 --> 00:07:55,830
This item is not on the Ministry of Rites

127
00:07:55,830 --> 00:07:56,720
gift list!

128
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,490
How dare you!

129
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:58,920
Your Highness!

130
00:07:59,190 --> 00:07:59,950
Stop!

131
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,630
Prince Wenbu, please behave yourself.

132
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:13,830
Inside Tianhuang City,

133
00:08:13,830 --> 00:08:14,920
you cannot draw weapons so easily.

134
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,920
The Divine Constable Bureau again.

135
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,750
Do you people
from the Divine Constable Bureau

136
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:20,680
enjoy going against me?

137
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,510
Please let Lord Zhang go.

138
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:47,150
The Divine Constable Bureau

139
00:08:47,150 --> 00:08:49,480
will definitely give you an explanation.

140
00:08:52,150 --> 00:08:53,120
Your Highness,

141
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,730
this is Great Shi territory after all.

142
00:08:56,150 --> 00:08:58,790
Why not give them a chance?

143
00:08:59,150 --> 00:09:00,630
If they can't find out,

144
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,800
it won't be too late for us to act.

145
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,150
Fine.

146
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,270
I'll give you a deadline.

147
00:09:12,390 --> 00:09:13,790
If the time passes

148
00:09:13,790 --> 00:09:14,840
and you still haven't found out,

149
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:17,030
don't blame me for taking action.

150
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:20,200
One day is enough.

151
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,100
What are you thinking?

152
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,910
I

153
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:27,750
will only give you the time of one dance.

154
00:09:28,590 --> 00:09:30,070
Come, play the music!

155
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,760
Dance!

156
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:25,060
[Clear as a Mirror]

157
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:25,360
Work carefully, all of you!

158
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,630
Especially the new guy!

159
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,510
Work hard!

160
00:10:42,630 --> 00:10:43,670
Don't slack off!

161
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,080
Wipe that clean

162
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:21,000
and put it up.

163
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,360
Mr. Qi.

164
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,360
Mr. Li.

165
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:26,670
I see

166
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:29,240
these weapons are very unique.

167
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,030
I wonder

168
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:32,110
what their origin is.

169
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,320
That's a long story.

170
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:35,600
These are all

171
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,330
the weapons of the past Chiefs.

172
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:38,720
This Zhanjieyu

173
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,670
is the sword of the first Chief,

174
00:11:39,670 --> 00:11:40,910
Ling Wufeng.

175
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:46,810
That Fufengqie is even more impressive.

176
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,550
The second Chief, Chu Xuanji,

177
00:11:47,700 --> 00:11:49,930
[Chu Xuanji, Second Chief] [Fufengqie]

178
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:51,550
held this sword to intimidate all evil.

179
00:11:55,670 --> 00:11:56,440
Our Divine Constable Bureau

180
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,790
is indeed mighty.

181
00:11:57,910 --> 00:11:58,870
Isn't it?

182
00:12:13,910 --> 00:12:15,000
This Chief Constable's Hall

183
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,360
is the office of the past Chiefs.

184
00:12:18,150 --> 00:12:21,360
It's surrounded by the patterns
of the nine sons of the dragon.

185
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:23,000
This bronze statue
of the Bi'an divine beast

186
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:25,120
crawls on the dome right in the middle,

187
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:27,320
symbolizing the strictness of the law.

188
00:12:29,030 --> 00:12:30,150
I see.

189
00:12:33,270 --> 00:12:34,080
Mr. Qi.

190
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:38,240
After we finish cleaning this hall

191
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:39,550
later,

192
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,150
can we

193
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:42,880
go clean the Tianshu Pavilion?

194
00:12:45,510 --> 00:12:47,120
What kind of place
is the Tianshu Pavilion?

195
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,510
Not even dust can fly in.

196
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:50,240
Do you think it needs cleaning?

197
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,790
Not even dust can fly in?

198
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,670
How did that person get in?

199
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,400
He is a Divine Constable.

200
00:12:57,790 --> 00:12:59,190
He just took out his token

201
00:13:02,790 --> 00:13:03,630
and went in.

202
00:13:08,910 --> 00:13:09,720
Then...

203
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:12,330
how can one become a Divine Constable?

204
00:13:12,630 --> 00:13:14,840
You are a trainee constable now.

205
00:13:15,150 --> 00:13:16,910
If you endure for 3 years
without making mistakes,

206
00:13:16,910 --> 00:13:18,080
you can be promoted.

207
00:13:19,670 --> 00:13:20,480
Three years?

208
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:21,600
After 3 years,

209
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,000
you will be a third-class constable,

210
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:23,790
just like me.

211
00:13:24,030 --> 00:13:25,440
You won't have to clean
the latrine anymore,

212
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,840
but can be a porter

213
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,750
and participate in some simple cases.

214
00:13:28,750 --> 00:13:29,630
Another 5 years,

215
00:13:29,630 --> 00:13:30,360
and you can become

216
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,630
a second-class constable.

217
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:32,840
But after becoming
a second-class constable,

218
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:34,150
you can't just bide your time.

219
00:13:34,150 --> 00:13:36,440
You have to accumulate
merits and solve cases.

220
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,910
Becoming a first-class constable

221
00:13:37,910 --> 00:13:39,000
depends on luck.

222
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,550
Generally speaking,
in the Divine Constable Bureau,

223
00:13:40,550 --> 00:13:41,790
constables with more than 20 years
of experience

224
00:13:41,790 --> 00:13:42,990
are all first-class.

225
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,120
Head Constable Yao
is a first-class constable.

226
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:51,240
It's just that he's old now.

227
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,200
His legs are not good,

228
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,730
and he can't go to the scene.

229
00:14:02,910 --> 00:14:03,720
Mr. Qi.

230
00:14:04,150 --> 00:14:06,010
Above the first-class constable

231
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,200
is the Divine Constable, right?

232
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,000
No.

233
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,720
Above the first-class constable

234
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:10,750
is the third-class head constable,

235
00:14:10,750 --> 00:14:11,630
then the second-class head constable,

236
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:12,720
then the first-class head constable,

237
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:13,440
and then the chief head constable.

238
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,150
Stop.

239
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:17,850
Then let me ask you.

240
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:20,750
Ms. Bai, Mr. Meng,

241
00:14:20,790 --> 00:14:21,790
and Lord Lou—

242
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:22,790
why are they Divine Constables

243
00:14:22,790 --> 00:14:24,000
at such a young age?

244
00:14:24,510 --> 00:14:25,390
That's because

245
00:14:25,390 --> 00:14:28,990
the Divine Constables
have all solved earth-shattering cases.

246
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,460
Earth-shattering cases?

247
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:45,510
Your Highness!

248
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:46,870
What should we do?

249
00:15:56,030 --> 00:15:56,430
[Benevolence and Neighborly Amity]

250
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,270
What's this whistle for?

251
00:16:06,270 --> 00:16:08,510
It's the order
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

252
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:09,440
It means that

253
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:10,960
no matter what case we are handling

254
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:11,910
and what stage it is at,

255
00:16:11,910 --> 00:16:13,120
we must stop temporarily

256
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:14,780
and gather at the crime scene.

257
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:15,960
That is to say,

258
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:18,120
just like nature calls,

259
00:16:18,660 --> 00:16:20,030
no matter how busy we are,

260
00:16:20,030 --> 00:16:21,360
we have to put it on hold.

261
00:16:21,370 --> 00:16:24,030
This is the earth-shattering case
I mentioned.

262
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:36,510
We want to see the Emperor of Great Shi

263
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,420
to ask for an explanation.

264
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,120
Step aside!

265
00:16:40,150 --> 00:16:41,100
-Step aside!
-Step aside!

266
00:16:41,100 --> 00:16:42,560
-Step aside!
-Step aside!

267
00:16:49,830 --> 00:16:51,560
-Head Constable Yan.
-Mr. Yan.

268
00:16:51,910 --> 00:16:54,320
The Divine Constable Bureau
has been established for 46 years.

269
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:57,150
Among all the major cases

270
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,000
and murder cases in Tianhuang City,

271
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,000
is there any that we couldn't solve?

272
00:17:00,030 --> 00:17:01,840
-No! No!
-No! No!

273
00:17:02,870 --> 00:17:05,200
But if someone takes
the opportunity to cause trouble,

274
00:17:05,069 --> 00:17:07,900
[Yan Cheng, Constable Iron]

275
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:08,270
can the Divine Constable Bureau
let outsiders

276
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:10,540
disturb the peace of the capital?

277
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:12,670
-No! No!
-No! No!

278
00:17:16,349 --> 00:17:17,839
You heard it.

279
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:21,270
We will solve the murder case.

280
00:17:21,829 --> 00:17:22,680
You

281
00:17:23,310 --> 00:17:25,380
must stay in the Envoy Residence.

282
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,310
You make it sound nice.

283
00:17:29,510 --> 00:17:30,910
Prince Wenbu was

284
00:17:30,930 --> 00:17:32,620
under the protection
of the Divine Constable Bureau

285
00:17:32,620 --> 00:17:33,680
when he was killed.

286
00:17:33,790 --> 00:17:35,720
How can I trust you?

287
00:17:36,710 --> 00:17:39,170
How can I trust
the Divine Constable Bureau?

288
00:18:00,310 --> 00:18:01,000
Yan,

289
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:01,790
are you okay?

290
00:18:02,400 --> 00:18:03,200
I'm fine.

291
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:08,550
It's you again.

292
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:12,350
Yes, it's me again.

293
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,720
Mr. Yan,

294
00:18:15,790 --> 00:18:16,920
didn't you go back to your hometown
to visit your relatives?

295
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:18,250
Why are you back so soon?

296
00:18:18,830 --> 00:18:19,550
As soon as I heard

297
00:18:19,550 --> 00:18:22,000
the news that the Northern Kun delegation
entered the capital,

298
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:23,350
I rushed back.

299
00:18:24,550 --> 00:18:25,480
You're new here?

300
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,720
You're quite bold.

301
00:18:29,790 --> 00:18:31,070
I've always been bold.

302
00:18:31,070 --> 00:18:32,200
Trainee Constable!

303
00:18:34,510 --> 00:18:35,310
Step back.

304
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,000
Yes.

305
00:18:37,830 --> 00:18:39,090
Divine Constable Lou.

306
00:18:39,790 --> 00:18:41,400
The men of Northern Kun

307
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,270
only die in battle;

308
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:44,940
they never fear death.

309
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,350
I came here this time

310
00:18:47,750 --> 00:18:49,680
to bring His Majesty's oral edict.

311
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:50,850
Listen to the edict!

312
00:18:53,830 --> 00:18:55,350
An oral decree from His Majesty:

313
00:18:55,350 --> 00:18:56,480
From this moment on,

314
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:58,400
the nine gates
of Tianhuang City are closed.

315
00:18:58,240 --> 00:19:00,930
[Tianhuang City]

316
00:19:00,510 --> 00:19:01,440
Scholars, farmers, artisans, merchants,

317
00:19:00,950 --> 00:19:02,050
[Proclamation]

318
00:19:01,510 --> 00:19:03,070
peddlers, and all other people,

319
00:19:02,070 --> 00:19:03,560
[Divine Constable Tally]

320
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:05,200
as well as officials below the third rank,

321
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:07,030
shall not enter or leave without an edict.

322
00:19:07,030 --> 00:19:09,240
The Divine Constable Bureau is ordered

323
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:11,350
to bring the murderer
to justice within 7 days.

324
00:19:11,350 --> 00:19:13,720
The Grand Secretariat
and the Ministry of Justice officials

325
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:16,030
must cooperate with the bureau
to hunt down the murderer.

326
00:19:16,030 --> 00:19:17,240
No disobedience is allowed.

327
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:17,900
-Yes!
-Yes!

328
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:18,710
-Yes!
-Yes!

329
00:19:18,730 --> 00:19:19,530
-Yes!
-Yes!

330
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:29,510
Mr. Yan,

331
00:19:30,150 --> 00:19:32,070
the Emperor's word is unbreakable.

332
00:19:32,070 --> 00:19:33,720
His Majesty will definitely
give Northern Kun

333
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:35,590
and Prince Wenbu justice.

334
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:49,030
Lord Yan.

335
00:19:49,510 --> 00:19:51,220
[Envoy Residence]

336
00:19:56,600 --> 00:19:57,240
That's hard to say.

337
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:58,000
I don't know.

338
00:19:58,350 --> 00:19:59,070
Something happened

339
00:19:59,070 --> 00:20:00,240
right in this room.

340
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:02,000
-Really?
-Who is so bold?

341
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:02,960
Prince Wenbu

342
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:05,200
was murdered under the protection
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

343
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,440
Since the establishment
of the Divine Constable Bureau

344
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,480
46 years ago,

345
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:09,280
[Divine Constable Bureau]

346
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:08,400
there has never been

347
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:10,000
such an appalling incident.

348
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:12,290
Normally speaking,

349
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:14,240
the Envoy Residence is heavily guarded.

350
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:14,920
Not even a bird

351
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:16,070
could fly in,

352
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:18,540
let alone a stranger going in and out.

353
00:20:39,030 --> 00:20:41,100
The gifts for foreign guests
should logically

354
00:20:41,100 --> 00:20:42,960
go through layers of inspection.

355
00:20:43,140 --> 00:20:44,950
How could the black chest

356
00:20:44,980 --> 00:20:47,110
appear out of thin air among the gifts?

357
00:20:47,200 --> 00:20:48,600
What's even stranger is,

358
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:49,590
the chest seems to have

359
00:20:49,590 --> 00:20:50,790
foreseen the future,

360
00:20:50,790 --> 00:20:51,880
predicting the scene of

361
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:53,110
Prince Wenbu's murder,

362
00:20:53,110 --> 00:20:55,110
with every detail exactly the same.

363
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,400
Given the condition of the corpse,

364
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:59,160
even Ms. Bai

365
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:00,310
has never seen it before,

366
00:21:00,310 --> 00:21:01,880
let alone examined it.

367
00:21:07,070 --> 00:21:08,270
Jiang Zhan, Ding Mao.

368
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:09,810
Go in and take a look.

369
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:23,640
My Lord!

370
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:24,400
What are you doing?

371
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:25,480
Let me in!

372
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,440
What kind of place do you think this is?

373
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:27,970
My cousin is still inside!

374
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:28,960
Young man.

375
00:21:29,070 --> 00:21:30,680
-Step back! Step back!
-Please let me in,

376
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:32,200
-okay?
-Back off! Back off!

377
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,400
Constable Eagle, Lord Lou,

378
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:35,000
asked me to wait for you here.

379
00:21:35,400 --> 00:21:36,350
Lord Lou?

380
00:21:37,310 --> 00:21:38,920
You're just an unregistered runner.

381
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,380
Why are you waiting for me?

382
00:21:41,110 --> 00:21:42,030
Young man,

383
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,550
do you know how I

384
00:21:43,550 --> 00:21:45,030
got into the Divine Constable Bureau?

385
00:21:45,030 --> 00:21:46,230
Step back! Step back!

386
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:47,600
Because

387
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:49,510
I have good handwriting.

388
00:21:50,310 --> 00:21:52,920
The so-called sweeping armies with a pen

389
00:21:53,110 --> 00:21:54,770
and writing with iron strokes

390
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:56,240
refer to me.

391
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:59,030
So at this scene,

392
00:21:59,200 --> 00:22:01,130
any copying and transcribing work

393
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:02,680
is my responsibility.

394
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:06,050
Then come in with me.

395
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:07,200
Alright.

396
00:22:15,270 --> 00:22:18,160
Sorting and classifying may seem boring,

397
00:22:18,910 --> 00:22:21,220
but it actually cultivates the mind

398
00:22:21,310 --> 00:22:22,680
and trains the eyes.

399
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:26,590
I can also practice my handwriting.

400
00:22:26,590 --> 00:22:27,680
Isn't it wonderful?

401
00:22:27,480 --> 00:22:30,280
[Class A‑2, Gem & Tribute Gifts]

402
00:22:30,300 --> 00:22:30,650
[Class A‑2, Gem & Tribute Gifts]
[Class C‑1, Gem & Tribute Gifts]

403
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:31,680
Friend.

404
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:33,570
Watch your step.

405
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:37,460
Be careful.

406
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,160
I think if I keep this up

407
00:22:49,200 --> 00:22:50,510
for 100 years,

408
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:53,260
I can become the fifth Divine Constable.

409
00:22:53,310 --> 00:22:54,070
Lord Yan.

410
00:22:56,920 --> 00:22:57,830
Lord Yan.

411
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:04,440
Yan.

412
00:23:05,030 --> 00:23:05,830
Your hand...

413
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:07,200
I'm fine.

414
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:08,270
How is it?

415
00:23:10,310 --> 00:23:11,110
The corpse...

416
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:13,280
Corpse fluid is hard to test.

417
00:23:13,510 --> 00:23:15,000
But judging from the smell,

418
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:16,510
it's the poison called Yama's Call—

419
00:23:16,510 --> 00:23:17,640
"Yama wants you dead at midnight;

420
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:18,590
who dares keep you until dawn?"—

421
00:23:18,590 --> 00:23:20,920
or the Seven-Step
Corpse-Dissolving Powder.

422
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:21,720
This thing

423
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:23,380
must be hard to get, right?

424
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:26,310
Not only are the ingredients
extremely rare,

425
00:23:26,310 --> 00:23:27,790
but the refining process

426
00:23:27,790 --> 00:23:28,720
is extremely dangerous.

427
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:29,400
One careless mistake,

428
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:30,920
and you might dissolve yourself.

429
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:31,590
It's said that

430
00:23:31,590 --> 00:23:33,070
among the masters who refine Yama's Call,

431
00:23:33,070 --> 00:23:35,070
9 out of 10 have missing fingers

432
00:23:35,070 --> 00:23:36,350
or are blind.

433
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,510
That makes it easy.

434
00:23:40,310 --> 00:23:41,710
We'll ask them one by one.

435
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:43,720
Interrogate all the black market
medicine sellers,

436
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:44,830
and we'll know

437
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:46,680
who the buyer is.

438
00:23:46,830 --> 00:23:48,510
Leave this to me.

439
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:50,310
A few lashes of the whip,

440
00:23:50,310 --> 00:23:51,510
and they'll confess everything.

441
00:23:51,510 --> 00:23:52,310
No need.

442
00:23:52,790 --> 00:23:53,830
As far as I know,

443
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:54,790
in this Tianhuang City,

444
00:23:54,790 --> 00:23:56,240
the only bottle of Yama's Call

445
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:58,480
is in the coroner's room
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

446
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,440
In your room.

447
00:24:00,070 --> 00:24:01,350
That's impossible.

448
00:24:01,830 --> 00:24:02,880
Our Divine Constable Bureau

449
00:24:02,880 --> 00:24:04,340
is already a den of tigers.

450
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:05,920
Your room

451
00:24:06,680 --> 00:24:08,080
is even more terrifying.

452
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:10,960
Why is he here?

453
00:24:13,340 --> 00:24:14,400
After all, he was personally recruited

454
00:24:14,400 --> 00:24:15,680
by the Chief.

455
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:17,140
We have to look out for him.

456
00:24:17,510 --> 00:24:19,200
Since there are no clues elsewhere,

457
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:21,240
we should start by interrogating people.

458
00:24:21,240 --> 00:24:23,070
The last ones to approach Prince Wenbu

459
00:24:23,070 --> 00:24:24,400
should be a few dancers.

460
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:27,280
Meng has already
started interrogating them.

461
00:24:30,550 --> 00:24:31,350
Where is he?

462
00:24:34,590 --> 00:24:35,680
So unlucky.

463
00:24:35,920 --> 00:24:37,270
I was hoping the prince

464
00:24:37,270 --> 00:24:38,790
would give some reward money,

465
00:24:38,790 --> 00:24:40,550
but now there's nothing.

466
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:54,100
You were supposed to be off today.

467
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:55,270
Why did you switch days

468
00:24:55,270 --> 00:24:56,330
with Miss Chuntao?

469
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:57,790
I...

470
00:24:59,750 --> 00:25:00,550
I...

471
00:25:01,030 --> 00:25:02,590
I admire Prince Wenbu of Northern Kun's

472
00:25:02,590 --> 00:25:03,590
peerless beauty,

473
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:04,880
and wanted to see him.

474
00:25:07,590 --> 00:25:09,250
I'll give you one more chance.

475
00:25:09,640 --> 00:25:10,550
Say it again.

476
00:25:12,510 --> 00:25:14,570
My brother owes money from gambling,

477
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:16,030
and my family is short of money.

478
00:25:16,030 --> 00:25:17,030
So I thought

479
00:25:17,030 --> 00:25:18,920
if I could get Prince Wenbu's
appreciation,

480
00:25:18,920 --> 00:25:20,580
I might get more reward money.

481
00:25:24,310 --> 00:25:25,070
Leave.

482
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:34,270
Miss.

483
00:25:38,310 --> 00:25:39,110
Miss.

484
00:25:39,510 --> 00:25:40,960
As a lady,

485
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:42,310
even if you're angry,

486
00:25:42,310 --> 00:25:43,720
you should smile more.

487
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:44,680
Because

488
00:25:45,310 --> 00:25:46,640
ladies who love to smile

489
00:25:46,680 --> 00:25:48,310
usually don't have bad luck.

490
00:25:48,510 --> 00:25:49,720
What is he doing now?

491
00:26:01,510 --> 00:26:02,480
Mr. Li.

492
00:26:03,030 --> 00:26:05,000
Taking advantage of the investigation
to flirt with women.

493
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:06,160
How carefree.

494
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:09,140
Ms. Bai, you are mistaken.

495
00:26:09,790 --> 00:26:11,320
I am taking advantage of...

496
00:26:13,310 --> 00:26:15,240
the opportunity to sort things out

497
00:26:15,590 --> 00:26:16,990
to investigate the case.

498
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:24,960
Miss.

499
00:26:26,920 --> 00:26:29,310
Why do you look so familiar?

500
00:26:32,590 --> 00:26:33,400
Have we

501
00:26:34,270 --> 00:26:35,310
met somewhere

502
00:26:35,310 --> 00:26:36,160
before?

503
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:48,270
Zhenzhu.

504
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:52,310
If this Corpse-Dissolving Powder
is used on a person,

505
00:26:52,310 --> 00:26:54,370
how long at most
will it take to take effect?

506
00:26:54,370 --> 00:26:55,400
At most the duration of a dance.

507
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:56,160
Otherwise, how could it have

508
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:57,490
the name "Yama's Call"?

509
00:26:59,510 --> 00:27:00,720
Before Wenbu died,

510
00:27:00,790 --> 00:27:02,390
he happened to watch a dance.

511
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:03,960
Based on the time,

512
00:27:04,270 --> 00:27:05,550
the murderer should have

513
00:27:05,550 --> 00:27:07,610
poisoned him in the Envoy Residence.

514
00:27:07,750 --> 00:27:08,510
After the poison took effect,

515
00:27:08,510 --> 00:27:10,640
the scene was sealed off,
and no one entered or left.

516
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:11,700
So the murderer...

517
00:27:15,880 --> 00:27:17,160
must still be here.

518
00:27:18,310 --> 00:27:19,770
Are the dancers suspects?

519
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:22,440
That's why I said,

520
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:23,310
"Leave it to me."

521
00:27:23,310 --> 00:27:24,880
A good whipping for each of them,

522
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:27,410
and they'll definitely confess everything.

523
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:38,440
Little Goldfish.

524
00:27:40,310 --> 00:27:41,840
I told you I recognized you.

525
00:27:41,920 --> 00:27:43,320
I didn't lie to you, did I?

526
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:46,830
Then do you remember me?

527
00:27:47,400 --> 00:27:48,640
Young Master Qingyang.

528
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:50,400
You often come with the Crown Prince.

529
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,720
Of course, I remember.

530
00:27:52,400 --> 00:27:53,920
Young Master Qingyang, do you remember me?

531
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:55,200
Do you remember me, Young Master Qingyang?

532
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:56,920
-Do you remember me?
-Do you remember me?

533
00:27:56,920 --> 00:27:57,720
Look.

534
00:27:58,920 --> 00:28:00,030
What is this?

535
00:28:00,540 --> 00:28:01,580
Silver!

536
00:28:01,610 --> 00:28:03,060
-Silver!
-Silver!

537
00:28:04,030 --> 00:28:05,350
Okay, let me show you.

538
00:28:06,510 --> 00:28:07,570
I want it. I want it.

539
00:28:09,440 --> 00:28:10,510
I want it.

540
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:13,030
Silver.

541
00:28:20,310 --> 00:28:21,110
Okay.

542
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:23,880
Don't rush.

543
00:28:23,880 --> 00:28:25,480
I'll ask you some questions.

544
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:27,110
If you answer well,

545
00:28:27,510 --> 00:28:30,310
there will naturally
be no shortage of reward silver.

546
00:28:30,310 --> 00:28:31,720
-Thank you, Young Master Qingyang.
-Thank you, Young Master Qingyang.

547
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:32,580
Ask us quickly.

548
00:28:33,070 --> 00:28:33,960
Let me ask you.

549
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:37,110
Both kind words and silver

550
00:28:37,110 --> 00:28:38,640
can achieve the goal.

551
00:28:39,830 --> 00:28:41,110
But why are some people

552
00:28:41,510 --> 00:28:43,170
always willing to use swords?

553
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:53,610
-Young Master, we'll take our leave.
-Young Master, we'll take our leave.

554
00:28:55,510 --> 00:28:56,310
Miss,

555
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:58,240
you have quite a few calluses

556
00:28:58,310 --> 00:28:59,310
on your hand.

557
00:29:03,310 --> 00:29:04,840
What are you doing, My Lord?

558
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:06,030
Sorry.

559
00:29:07,310 --> 00:29:08,110
My apology.

560
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:11,030
Mr. Meng, your mind is now

561
00:29:11,030 --> 00:29:12,070
full of the case.

562
00:29:12,640 --> 00:29:13,440
I guess

563
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:14,750
you thought

564
00:29:14,750 --> 00:29:16,270
this lady's calluses

565
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:17,640
were on her thumb web.

566
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:19,880
You suspected she was an assassin

567
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:22,340
who has been wielding
swords for a long time.

568
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:24,510
But this lady's calluses

569
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:26,140
are on her fingertips.

570
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:29,780
This is caused by doing manual labor
for a long time.

571
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:35,070
Mr. Meng.

572
00:29:36,240 --> 00:29:38,070
I have frequented brothels
for a long time,

573
00:29:38,070 --> 00:29:40,130
often buying some unfortunate women

574
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:41,640
into the Star-Gathering Pavilion

575
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:42,970
to help them start anew.

576
00:29:44,590 --> 00:29:45,400
So,

577
00:29:47,790 --> 00:29:49,920
I know these ladies better than you do.

578
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:51,920
As for interrogating the dancers,

579
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:53,310
why not leave it to me?

580
00:30:07,510 --> 00:30:08,350
It seems

581
00:30:09,030 --> 00:30:10,830
we are both unfortunate people.

582
00:30:11,590 --> 00:30:13,640
Young Master Qingyang,
you're the richest in the world.

583
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:15,240
How can you be like me?

584
00:30:20,310 --> 00:30:21,240
Then why don't we

585
00:30:21,720 --> 00:30:23,640
have a good talk about

586
00:30:24,110 --> 00:30:25,070
what it means to

587
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:28,680
meet by chance without prior acquaintance?

588
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:46,480
I wonder what advice you have,
Young Master Qingyang.

589
00:30:49,210 --> 00:30:50,450
I also want to ask you

590
00:30:53,310 --> 00:30:55,270
why you killed Prince Wenbu.

591
00:30:56,600 --> 00:30:58,950
W-What are you talking about?

592
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:01,880
Prince Wenbu had expert guards,

593
00:31:02,310 --> 00:31:03,920
and I don't know how to fight.

594
00:31:05,000 --> 00:31:06,350
How could I kill him?

595
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:08,440
True.

596
00:31:09,070 --> 00:31:10,920
You indeed don't know martial arts,

597
00:31:10,920 --> 00:31:12,920
and you don't have calluses on your hands

598
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:14,920
from holding a sword for a long time.

599
00:31:16,480 --> 00:31:17,310
But...

600
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,510
your fingers

601
00:31:22,070 --> 00:31:23,480
are still rough

602
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:25,260
and peeling severely.

603
00:31:25,510 --> 00:31:26,200
This is because

604
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:28,240
people who develop poisons for a long time

605
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:29,920
inevitably get poison on their hands

606
00:31:29,920 --> 00:31:31,880
and need to wash them frequently.

607
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:37,510
I guess

608
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:40,100
you are an expert in using poison.

609
00:31:42,310 --> 00:31:43,110
Not long ago,

610
00:31:43,790 --> 00:31:46,070
I came to the Envoy Residence
with the Crown Prince.

611
00:31:46,070 --> 00:31:47,720
I admired your zither skills

612
00:31:48,110 --> 00:31:51,310
and wanted to invite you
to the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

613
00:31:51,480 --> 00:31:52,270
I offered a price

614
00:31:52,270 --> 00:31:54,160
that no one could refuse.

615
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:55,720
But you

616
00:31:58,510 --> 00:31:59,720
refused.

617
00:32:01,030 --> 00:32:01,830
So,

618
00:32:02,590 --> 00:32:04,450
you stayed at the Envoy Residence

619
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:05,880
because there must be something

620
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:07,510
you have to do, right?

621
00:32:17,880 --> 00:32:20,340
I didn't expect that
my long-planned scheme

622
00:32:23,680 --> 00:32:25,960
was exposed by a playboy.

623
00:32:27,270 --> 00:32:28,880
It's truly a trick of fate.

624
00:32:30,640 --> 00:32:32,770
Young Master Qingyang, you're right.

625
00:32:33,930 --> 00:32:35,710
I do have some knowledge

626
00:32:36,150 --> 00:32:37,550
of toxicology.

627
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:58,300
Oh no.

628
00:33:14,920 --> 00:33:16,450
What is the meaning of this?

629
00:33:19,510 --> 00:33:21,710
I was afraid your sword would be too fast

630
00:33:21,830 --> 00:33:23,310
and kill the suspect.

631
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:25,780
When the Severe-Cold Sword is drawn,

632
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:27,030
someone must die.

633
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:28,240
Not necessarily.

634
00:33:31,270 --> 00:33:32,830
Aren't you an exception?

635
00:33:38,750 --> 00:33:39,550
Let's go.

636
00:33:49,110 --> 00:33:51,070
My Lords, it's time to eat.

637
00:33:56,510 --> 00:33:58,310
Yan, any results yet?

638
00:33:58,680 --> 00:34:00,070
Before we even used torture,

639
00:34:00,070 --> 00:34:01,600
she confessed everything.

640
00:34:05,830 --> 00:34:07,830
This woman has a tragic background.

641
00:34:08,190 --> 00:34:09,480
Her father and brothers
all died tragically

642
00:34:09,480 --> 00:34:11,110
under the iron hooves of Northern Kun.

643
00:34:11,110 --> 00:34:12,440
So last year,

644
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:14,320
she sneaked in here as a dancer,

645
00:34:14,320 --> 00:34:15,800
waiting for a chance to seek revenge.

646
00:34:15,800 --> 00:34:16,860
But unexpectedly,

647
00:34:17,190 --> 00:34:18,790
before she could make a move,

648
00:34:19,070 --> 00:34:21,030
Prince Wenbu had died.

649
00:34:21,510 --> 00:34:22,320
That's all.

650
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:24,960
In that case,

651
00:34:25,110 --> 00:34:26,800
detain her in the Divine Constable Bureau

652
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:28,510
for attempted murder pending trial.

653
00:34:28,510 --> 00:34:29,320
-Yes.
-Yes.

654
00:34:35,230 --> 00:34:37,290
Sometimes I really don't understand

655
00:34:37,670 --> 00:34:40,630
which is more important,

656
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:42,980
revenge or living a good life.

657
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:48,070
Don't judge others

658
00:34:49,230 --> 00:34:51,290
unless you've walked in their shoes.

659
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:13,320
Where is Mr. Meng?

660
00:35:14,230 --> 00:35:15,230
Who knows?

661
00:35:15,280 --> 00:35:16,230
That ice block

662
00:35:16,230 --> 00:35:17,360
is always so aloof.

663
00:35:18,710 --> 00:35:20,440
The scene investigation and interrogation

664
00:35:20,440 --> 00:35:21,630
yielded nothing.

665
00:35:22,400 --> 00:35:23,510
We questioned all suspects,

666
00:35:23,510 --> 00:35:24,710
but made no progress.

667
00:35:25,480 --> 00:35:26,760
Right after Wenbu died,

668
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:27,320
our people

669
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:28,440
locked down the scene.

670
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:29,920
Everyone and everything was checked.

671
00:35:29,920 --> 00:35:31,800
Not even a piece of paper
could be thrown out.

672
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:32,960
But we couldn't find any clues

673
00:35:32,960 --> 00:35:34,320
on anyone.

674
00:35:35,110 --> 00:35:37,040
Could it be that we're looking
in the wrong direction,

675
00:35:37,040 --> 00:35:38,370
and the murderer

676
00:35:38,390 --> 00:35:39,850
is actually from without?

677
00:35:40,590 --> 00:35:41,400
Impossible.

678
00:35:42,800 --> 00:35:44,230
Why are you so sure?

679
00:35:46,710 --> 00:35:47,970
Because of the timing.

680
00:35:50,440 --> 00:35:51,360
My Lords,

681
00:35:51,800 --> 00:35:52,710
think about it.

682
00:35:53,320 --> 00:35:55,980
The Corpse-Dissolving Powder
is highly toxic.

683
00:35:56,110 --> 00:35:56,960
If

684
00:35:57,230 --> 00:35:58,110
Wenbu had been poisoned

685
00:35:58,110 --> 00:35:59,480
outside,

686
00:35:59,710 --> 00:36:01,280
he would have died

687
00:36:01,480 --> 00:36:03,810
before the dancers even started dancing.

688
00:36:15,190 --> 00:36:16,030
Ms. Bai,

689
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:18,510
your noodles have been sitting for so long

690
00:36:18,510 --> 00:36:19,770
and have gotten soggy.

691
00:36:19,880 --> 00:36:21,010
Are they still good?

692
00:36:22,670 --> 00:36:24,280
Young Master Qingyang,
you're used to fine dining,

693
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:26,940
so naturally, you can't stand
this coarse food.

694
00:36:30,670 --> 00:36:31,480
I mean,

695
00:36:31,920 --> 00:36:34,440
noodles get soggy if left for too long.

696
00:36:51,710 --> 00:36:52,880
It's really possible that Wenbu

697
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:54,280
took the poison outside.

698
00:37:00,480 --> 00:37:02,210
Noodles get soggy when soaked,

699
00:37:02,230 --> 00:37:03,360
and paper wrapped in the stomach
for a long time

700
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:04,490
will also dissolve.

701
00:37:04,590 --> 00:37:06,070
As long as the murderer
used a medicinal film

702
00:37:06,070 --> 00:37:08,030
or paper to wrap the powder,

703
00:37:08,110 --> 00:37:09,480
let Wenbu swallow it,

704
00:37:09,710 --> 00:37:10,510
and then...

705
00:37:20,280 --> 00:37:21,230
This way,

706
00:37:21,230 --> 00:37:22,480
if the timing was calculated well,

707
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:24,070
even if Wenbu took the poison

708
00:37:24,070 --> 00:37:25,190
before coming to the Envoy Residence,

709
00:37:25,190 --> 00:37:27,120
he could last until after the dance

710
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:30,080
when the powder finally
dissolved in his stomach.

711
00:37:33,280 --> 00:37:34,070
So,

712
00:37:34,670 --> 00:37:36,960
the murderer is indeed from without.

713
00:37:46,880 --> 00:37:47,880
Still not right.

714
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:56,760
If the murderer

715
00:37:56,760 --> 00:37:59,320
wanted to create
the effect of a murder warning,

716
00:37:59,320 --> 00:38:01,070
he must have calculated exactly

717
00:38:01,070 --> 00:38:03,510
when Wenbu took the poison
and when it would act,

718
00:38:03,510 --> 00:38:05,070
without any error.

719
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:08,640
If the murderer was outside,

720
00:38:08,670 --> 00:38:09,880
there's no way

721
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,880
he could calculate it so precisely.

722
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:14,510
So is the murderer outside

723
00:38:14,880 --> 00:38:16,280
or inside?

724
00:38:24,630 --> 00:38:26,630
There's another suspicious point.

725
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:28,080
Generally speaking,

726
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,530
destroying a corpse

727
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:30,510
is to prevent people

728
00:38:30,510 --> 00:38:31,960
from finding it.

729
00:38:32,230 --> 00:38:32,960
But the murderer

730
00:38:32,960 --> 00:38:34,440
has already murdered someone

731
00:38:34,440 --> 00:38:35,360
in plain sight.

732
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:36,880
Then why

733
00:38:37,710 --> 00:38:39,150
dissolve the corpse?

734
00:38:40,710 --> 00:38:42,880
Is it purely to scare people?

735
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:47,070
Also,

736
00:38:48,110 --> 00:38:50,640
since the murderer
is so precise with poison,

737
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:52,110
any poison

738
00:38:52,110 --> 00:38:53,320
would do.

739
00:38:53,630 --> 00:38:55,110
Why must he choose

740
00:38:55,110 --> 00:38:56,280
such an expensive

741
00:38:56,320 --> 00:38:58,190
and easily traceable

742
00:38:58,190 --> 00:38:59,790
Corpse-Dissolving Powder?

743
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:03,960
Not bad, newbie.

744
00:39:04,280 --> 00:39:05,840
Your analysis makes sense.

745
00:39:08,840 --> 00:39:12,360
-Lord Constable Iron, I'm...
-Then what, in your view, is the cause?
